{
  "note": [
    "ID-REVIEW-1049 第八轮（2026-11-02）：**树内与树外共用同一份语料**。",
    "",
    "背景：树内扫描器（Tests/ClipMemoryTests/TestSourceScanner.swift 的",
    "blankingCommentsAndStrings）与树外契约脚本（Scripts/test/test_verify_production_canaries.sh",
    "的 blank_swift）是**两份独立实现** ⇒ 它们的口径只要差一条，就会出现",
    "「树内数出来 = 树外数出来 ≠ 真货」⇒ ⇒ 第八轮实测：契约脚本**没抹",
    "`\"\"\"…\"\"\"`** ⇒ 断言藏进多行字面量 ⇒ 树内 15 tests / 0 failures +",
    "契约 exit 0 ⇒ **两边同时失明**。",
    "",
    "⇒ ⇒ 本文件把「口径一致」变成**机械**事实：两个实现都必须对**每条**",
    "语料给出**同样的**期望值 ⇒ 任何一边改动导致口径漂移 ⇒ 那一边的",
    "校验立刻变红。",
    "",
    "⚠️ 期望值取自 **Swift 语言语义**（不是取自某一个实现）⇒ 语料被改弱了，",
    "本文件的 sha256（硬编码在契约脚本里）会不匹配 ⇒ exit 1。",
    "",
    "字段：name = 用例名；lines = 源码逐行；expect_assertions = 抹白后",
    "XCTAssert*/XCTFail/XCTUnwrap 的**出现次数**；expect_func_tests = 抹白后",
    "`func test…(` 的**出现次数**。两条路径都用同一份抹白结果 ⇒ 语料同时守住",
    "「断言数棘轮」与「func test 数棘轮」。"
  ],
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "real_assertion",
      "lines": [
        "func f() {",
        "    XCTAssertTrue(true)",
        "}"
      ],
      "expect_assertions": 1,
      "expect_func_tests": 0
    },
    {
      "name": "real_assertion_multiline",
      "lines": [
        "func f() {",
        "    XCTAssertTrue(",
        "        a == b",
        "    )",
        "}"
      ],
      "expect_assertions": 1,
      "expect_func_tests": 0
    },
    {
      "name": "comment_fill",
      "lines": [
        "func f() {",
        "    // XCTAssertTrue(true)",
        "    // XCTFail(\"boom\")",
        "}"
      ],
      "expect_assertions": 0,
      "expect_func_tests": 0
    },
    {
      "name": "block_comment",
      "lines": [
        "func f() {",
        "    /* XCTAssertTrue(true)",
        "       XCTFail(\"boom\") */",
        "}"
      ],
      "expect_assertions": 0,
      "expect_func_tests": 0
    },
    {
      "name": "nested_block_comment",
      "lines": [
        "func f() {",
        "    /* outer /* inner */ XCTAssertTrue(true) */",
        "}"
      ],
      "expect_assertions": 0,
      "expect_func_tests": 0
    },
    {
      "name": "multiline_literal",
      "lines": [
        "func f() {",
